# DocuSentinel AI — Frontend Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# For LOCAL development:
#   Leave VITE_API_URL blank — Vite dev server proxies /api → localhost:8000
#
# For PRODUCTION on Vercel:
#   The vercel.json rewrites handle /api → Render backend automatically.
#   You do NOT need to set VITE_API_URL on Vercel if using vercel.json rewrites.
#
#   If you are NOT using vercel.json rewrites, set:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://docusentinel-api.onrender.com/api
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_API_URL=
